{ "entry_number":1271,"title":"Trump's Promise Dashboard Showed More Complicated and In-Progress Items Than Kept","date_start":"2026-02-28","date_end":"2026-02-28","synopsis":"AP's tracker snapshot showed Trump's second-term promise list split across kept, in-progress and complicated buckets, with unresolved categories outweighing clean completions. The distribution mattered because it challenged campaign messaging that implied near-total execution. By quantifying status rather than repeating talking points, the dashboard exposed the difference between declaration and delivery.","rationale":"AP's status distribution showed unresolved promises outnumbering clear completions under Trump.","category":"Conspiracy Theories / Disinformation","subcategory":"Systematic Presidential Lying","phase":"White House 2","keywords":["AP tracker","promise status","kept vs complicated","delivery gap","Trump claims"],"metrics_key":"promise","scores":make_scores("2026-02-28","Conspiracy Theories / Disinformation","Systematic Presidential Lying",6,4,7,5,3,4,8,9,"AP status buckets showed unresolved promises outweighing fully kept items.")},
{ "entry_number":1272,"title":"Trump Classified-Records Promise Marked Kept While Broader Transparency Disputes Persisted","date_start":"2026-02-28","date_end":"2026-02-28","synopsis":"AP's tracker listed Trump's promise to release key classified files as kept, but the broader information-governance landscape remained contested in parallel controversies. The contrast highlighted a recurring dynamic: a narrow tracked promise can score as complete while adjacent transparency issues continue to fuel institutional mistrust. Completion metrics and accountability confidence are not always the same thing.","rationale":"A tracked classified-records promise was marked kept despite wider transparency conflicts.","category":"Government Corruption","subcategory":"Transparency Obstruction","phase":"White House 2","keywords":["classified files","kept status","transparency","AP tracker","information governance"],"metrics_key":"promise","scores":make_scores("2026-02-28","Government Corruption","Transparency Obstruction",6,5,6,5,3,3,6,9,"AP marked a classified-records promise kept while broader transparency disputes persisted.")},
{ "entry_number":1273,"title":"Trump School-Funding Threat Over Vaccine Mandates Rated 'Complicated' by AP Tracker","date_start":"2026-02-28","date_end":"2026-02-28","synopsis":"AP's tracker categorized Trump's pledge to cut federal money to schools with vaccine requirements as complicated rather than resolved. The status suggested significant legal, political, or implementation friction despite aggressive campaign framing. The promise became an example of how culturally charged proposals can stall once they meet institutional constraints.","rationale":"AP rated Trump's school-funding punishment promise as complicated, not completed.","category":"Authoritarianism","subcategory":"Government Power Abuse","phase":"White House 2","keywords":["schools","vaccine mandates","federal funding","complicated status","AP tracker"],"metrics_key":"promise","scores":make_scores("2026-02-28","Authoritarianism","Government Power Abuse",6,5,6,7,3,3,6,9,"AP rated Trump's school-funding punishment promise as complicated.")},
{ "entry_number":1274,"title":"Trump Plan to Shut Down Education Department Listed as In Progress, Not Completed","date_start":"2026-02-28","date_end":"2026-02-28","synopsis":"AP's promise tracker showed Trump's push to dismantle the U.S. Department of Education as in progress, indicating partial movement without final execution. The gap between political certainty and administrative finality reflected the structural difficulty of dismantling major federal institutions. The status weakened claims of finished delivery.","rationale":"A headline promise to close the Education Department remained in progress on AP's tracker.","category":"Authoritarianism","subcategory":"Government Power Abuse","phase":"White House 2","keywords":["Education Department","in progress","federal agencies","institutional rollback","promise tracking"],"metrics_key":"promise","scores":make_scores("2026-02-28","Authoritarianism","Government Power Abuse",7,6,7,8,3,3,6,9,"AP marked Trump's Education Department shutdown promise as still in progress.")},
{ "entry_number":1275,"title":"Trump EV-Mandate Rollback Promise Still In Progress According to AP","date_start":"2026-02-28","date_end":"2026-02-28","synopsis":"AP's tracker listed Trump's pledge to reverse Biden-era electric-vehicle mandates as in progress rather than completed. The status reflected policy movement with unresolved legal and regulatory endpoints. In practical terms, in-progress designations show that headline reversals can take longer and encounter more friction than campaign rhetoric implies.","rationale":"EV-mandate rollback was still in progress, undercutting claims of full completion.","category":"Conspiracy Theories / Disinformation","subcategory":"Systematic Presidential Lying","phase":"White House 2","keywords":["EV mandate","in progress","regulatory rollback","AP promises","completion gap"],"metrics_key":"economy","scores":make_scores("2026-02-28","Conspiracy Theories / Disinformation","Systematic Presidential Lying",6,4,7,5,3,3,7,9,"AP showed Trump's EV rollback promise remained in progress.")},
{ "entry_number":1276,"title":"Trump Emissions-Waiver Reversal Promise Also Stayed In Progress on AP Tracker","date_start":"2026-02-28","date_end":"2026-02-28","synopsis":"AP's tracker placed Trump's pledge to terminate emissions waivers in the in-progress category, signaling unresolved implementation status. The classification highlighted that legal durability and final regulatory effect lagged behind campaign declarations. As with other items, the scoreboard challenged broad claims of total promise completion.","rationale":"AP rated emissions-waiver rollback as ongoing rather than complete under Trump.","category":"Conspiracy Theories / Disinformation","subcategory":"Systematic Presidential Lying","phase":"White House 2","keywords":["emissions waivers","in progress","environment rollback","AP tracker","policy status"],"metrics_key":"economy","scores":make_scores("2026-02-28","Conspiracy Theories / Disinformation","Systematic Presidential Lying",6,4,7,5,3,3,7,9,"AP listed Trump's emissions-waiver rollback promise as in progress.")},
{ "entry_number":1277,"title":"Trump's Energy-Emergency Pledge Registered as Kept in AP Promise Tracker","date_start":"2026-02-28","date_end":"2026-02-28","synopsis":"AP's tracker showed Trump's declaration of a national energy emergency as a kept promise, reflecting formal action on one of his energy-platform priorities. Even so, kept status on declaration-type promises did not automatically resolve downstream outcomes like price targets or infrastructure constraints. The entry illustrated how procedural completion can coexist with substantive disputes.","rationale":"AP marked Trump's energy-emergency pledge as kept through formal action.","category":"Foreign Policy","subcategory":"Economic Warfare","phase":"White House 2","keywords":["energy emergency","kept promise","AP tracker","formal action","policy outcomes"],"metrics_key":"economy","scores":make_scores("2026-02-28","Foreign Policy","Economic Warfare",6,4,7,5,3,3,6,9,"AP marked Trump's energy-emergency promise kept through formal declaration.")},
{ "entry_number":1278,"title":"Trump Paris-Agreement Exit Promise Marked Kept While Climate Fallout Debate Continued","date_start":"2026-02-28","date_end":"2026-02-28","synopsis":"AP's tracker listed Trump's withdrawal-from-Paris pledge as kept, indicating procedural completion of a major climate-policy reversal. The classification did not settle policy impact debates, but it confirmed alignment between rhetoric and this specific action. The case showed how promise tracking can separate binary delivery from broader consequence analysis.","rationale":"AP marked Trump's Paris-exit pledge kept, even as climate-policy consequences remained contested.","category":"Foreign Policy","subcategory":"Economic Warfare","phase":"White House 2","keywords":["Paris Agreement","withdrawal","kept status","climate policy","AP promises"],"metrics_key":"economy","scores":make_scores("2026-02-28","Foreign Policy","Economic Warfare",6,4,7,5,3,3,6,9,"AP marked Trump's Paris-withdrawal promise kept.")},
